  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00t`[id_this, id_market(this, data), id_collateral(share_token)]`. `InvalidData` unless\0a`data` names the Templar vault.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00!The asset, fixed at construction.\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00`The batch `seq` while it exists: settled batches stay until every member has\0acollected its part.\00\00\00\05batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03seq\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00>`vault`'s claims as stored: `(batch, shares)`, settled or not.\00\00\00\00\00\06claims\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e3`(held, units, cash, parked)`: the strategy's free Templar shares, the sum of every\0avault's units, the USDC it holds for vaults' paid claims, and the shares it holds for\0athe open batch and for refunded claims not yet collected.\00\00\00\00\06ledger\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00pThe batch in flight and the open batch, if any:\0a`(seq, stage, shares, expected, counted, members)`. At most two.\00\00\00\07batches\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\c5Keeper only. Settles the batch in flight, files the open batch when it can, and moves\0athe price anchor on; claims nothing (this vault has no incentive to claim). Emits\0a`Harvest`. `data` is ignored.\00\00\00\00\00\00\07harvest\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\03\e8\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\000The Templar vault this strategy holds shares of.\00\00\00\07templar\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\13\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\a4Deposits `assets`, pulled from the vault, into the Templar vault with Templar's\0aown `convert_to_shares(assets)` as the minimum, and credits the vault with units for\0athe shares its balance rose by. The vault first collects its parts of settled\0abatches. `InvalidAmount` unless the strategy holds `assets` of USDC beyond what it\0aholds for vaults' paid claims; `ProtocolRejected` while\0aTemplar's price stands above the gain bound, or if Templar refuses (paused, busy, its\0avalue too old) or mints nothing. `change` is the position's value now minus the\0avalue last recorded. The protocol total grows by `assets` (Q89), less what the\0aposition's principal stood above its value (Q90).\00\00\00\08allocate\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e7`vault`'s position, with its settled claims as if collected: units, value last\0areported, principal, what its claims still waiting on Templar count for, the USDC paid\0afor it and waiting, and how many claims still wait (at most two).\00\00\00\00\08position\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\03vPays `assets` to the vault, after it collects its parts of settled batches: first from\0athe USDC Templar paid for the vault's claims, then the rest by an atomic exit from the Templar vault's idle USDC, which may burn at\0amost the vault's own free shares. Units are burned for the shares the exit burned,\0arounded up. The vault must receive exactly `assets`. Never gated by approval or the\0aprotocol cap. `InsufficientPosition` if `assets` is above what the position can pay\0anow (its paid USDC plus its free shares at their counted value);\0a`InsufficientLiquidity` when the rest is above Templar's `max_withdraw` for the\0astrategy (its idle USDC; 0 while it is paused or busy); `ProtocolRejected` if Templar\0arefuses anyway or pays the vault anything but exactly `assets`. The\0aprotocol total loses the principal taken out (Q89), and whatever of the rest stands\0aabove the position's value (Q90).\00\00\00\00\00\0adeallocate\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\94Anyone: settles the batch in flight from what Templar sent back (see `settle`), then\0afiles the open batch if none is in flight and Templar takes it.\00\00\00\0async_exits\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\9bThe vault's free shares and its shares in the open batch at their counted value\0a(Templar's `convert_to_assets`, rounded down, and no more than the gain-bounded price),\0aplus its claim on the batch in flight at that batch's counted payout (pro rata,\0arounded down), plus the USDC paid for it; settled claims count as if collected. The\0avalue last recorded when Templar does not answer. Never fails and never writes.\00\00\00\00\0breal_assets\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00-The cap on `total_allocated()`; 0 means none.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cprotocol_cap\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\f5A core vault's allocator or sentinel (`caller`, in that vault's own `config()`) queues\0aan exit of about `assets` of the vault's position at the Templar vault: the shares an\0aexit of `assets` takes leave the vault's free position and join the open batch, which\0agoes to Templar as one request, paid to the strategy itself, as soon as no batch is in\0aflight (this call files it when none is). Until then the shares keep earning; once\0afiled, the claim counts at the payout Templar fixed and earns nothing. Returns the\0abatch joined. `NotAuthorized` for any other caller; `InsufficientPosition` if the\0ashares are more than the vault's free shares; `InvalidAmount` if they are worth less\0athan Templar's minimum request; `ProtocolRejected` if Templar does not answer.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0crequest_exit\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\04\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01bOne instance per Templar vault. `factory` decides which vaults may allocate;\0a`cap_authority` alone sets the protocol cap; `keeper` alone may call `harvest`;\0a`withdrawal_period` is the Templar vault's cooldown, in seconds, shown to the API.\0a`InvalidConfig` unless `templar` answers `proxy_view` with `asset` and `share_token` as\0aits asset and share token.\00\00\00\00\00\0d__constructor\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07factory\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dcap_authority\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07templar\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bshare_token\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11withdrawal_period\00\00\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01jAnyone: lowers `vault`'s principal, and the protocol total by the same amount, to the\0aposition's value now when that is lower, and emits `PrincipalSynced`. Never raises it,\0amoves no money and reports no `change`. A position that does not exist, or a Templar\0avault that does not answer, is left as it is (Q90). `InvalidData` unless `data` names\0athe Templar vault.\00\00\00\00\00\0dsync_position\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\a5What `deallocate(vault, data, x)` can pay right now: the USDC paid for the vault's\0aclaims plus what an atomic exit of its free shares can take from Templar's idle\0a(`max_withdraw` of the strategy, which counts every vault's shares, so it is taken\0awith the vault's own counted value). Settled claims count as if collected; claims\0astill waiting on Templar are not in it. 0 on malformed `data` or a failed read. Never\0awrites.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0emax_deallocate\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04data\00\00\00\0e\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00DSum of the principal every vault has put in and not taken out (Q89).\00\00\00\0ftotal_allocated\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00&Cap authority only. 0 removes the cap.\00\00\00\00\00\10set_protocol_cap\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03cap\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\02\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b2Seconds a queued exit waits at least: the Templar vault's cooldown, fixed at\0adeployment. Non-zero: this strategy is never a liquidity strategy. The payout itself\0ahas no deadline.\00\00\00\00\00\11withdrawal_period\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\81The batch `batch` went to Templar as one request, `templar_id` (0 if Templar's receipt had\0anone), paying `expected` for `shares`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aBatchFiled\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0bbatch_filed\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0atemplar_id\00\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08expected\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00ETemplar paid the batch in flight (`paid`), or handed its shares back.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cBatchSettled\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0dbatch_settled\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04paid\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\96`vault` collected its part of a settled batch: `assets` of a payout, now waiting in the\0astrategy for it, or `shares` handed back, now its units again.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dExitCollected\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0eexit_collected\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\05\00\00\00aA vault's allocator or sentinel added `shares` of the vault's position to the open batch\0a`batch`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dExitRequested\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0eexit_requested\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\01\00\00\01NRequests gathered into one Templar request. Stages: `STAGE_OPEN` (gathering, its shares\0astill in the strategy), `STAGE_FILED` (Templar's escrow; at most one batch at a time),\0a`STAGE_PAID` (Templar paid `expected`), `STAGE_REFUNDED` (Templar handed the shares back).\0aA settled batch is removed once every member has collected its part.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05Batch\00\00\00\00\00\00\08\00\00\00'USDC of a paid batch not collected yet.\00\00\00\00\0bassets_left\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00PWhat it counts for while in flight: `expected`, bounded like any reported value.\00\00\00\07counted\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\002What Templar pays for it, fixed when it was filed.\00\00\00\00\00\08expected\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\22Members' shares not collected yet.\00\00\00\00\00\04left\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00#How many vaults hold a claim on it.\00\00\00\00\07members\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\1dThe members' shares together.\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05stage\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00$Templar's request id, for reference.\00\00\00\0atemplar_id\00\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\009What a strategy returns from `allocate` and `deallocate`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0aAllocation\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00<Signed change of the vault's position value under those IDs.\00\00\00\06change\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00@Risk IDs this move touched; never empty; the first is `id_this`.\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\04\00\00\00`Errors shared by every strategy: 5400\e2\80\935449. 5450\e2\80\935499 are for codes only one strategy needs.\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dStrategyError\00\00\00\00\00\00\12\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dNotAuthorized\00\00\00\00\00\15\18\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10VaultNotApproved\00\00\15\19\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidAmount\00\00\00\00\00\15\1a\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bInvalidData\00\00\00\15\1b\00\00\00/The vault holds less than it asked to take out.\00\00\00\00\14InsufficientPosition\00\00\15\1c\00\00\00\22The protocol cannot pay right now.\00\00\00\00\00\15InsufficientLiquidity\00\00\00\00\00\15\1d\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13ProtocolCapExceeded\00\00\00\15\1e\00\00\001